WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Germs land on you all day: on
your skin, in the air you breathe,

2
00:00:04.940 --> 00:00:07.140
in every mouthful of food.

3
00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:12.420
The first time you meet a new one, your
specific defences need days to respond.

4
00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:16.000
Days is plenty of time
for a germ to move in.

5
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.840
Yet most never get in at all,
and most that do never get far.

6
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.400
So what stops them, long
before those days are up?

7
00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:28.700
In this mission, you'll explore the
defences that are already in place before

8
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.060
any infection.

9
00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:34.480
Then you'll compare two defence
systems: one immediate and general,

10
00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.900
one slower and specific.

11
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.140
Your mission: find out what
stops germs getting in,

12
00:00:40.190 --> 00:00:41.950
and what stops them getting far.
